  m_Name: AfterStarScript
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - A star can represent feeling alone in space, but when you see many stars together
    on the map, it shows there are others who feel the same. This allows our users
    to know they aren't alone.
